{
  "slug": "the-c-library-that-got-rebuilt-in-rust",
  "title": "The C library that got rebuilt in Rust",
  "dek": "How do you replace a C library without breaking everything around it?",
  "description": "A drop-in Rust rewrite that treats ABI compatibility as the actual product.",
  "category": "BUILD",
